1
00:00:25,498 --> 00:00:30,360
Huddled in the shadows of the stairwell,

2
00:00:31,763 --> 00:00:35,803
Knees pulled tight against my chest.

3
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:43,595
Watching from above as my mother stands below,

4
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:48,186
Pleading for a love that wouldn't rest.

5
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:55,107
And the guilt cuts deeper than the cold,

6
00:00:56,807 --> 00:01:01,580
I broke her heart by letting out my own.

7
00:01:03,138 --> 00:01:08,093
I laid my bleeding on her kitchen floor,

8
00:01:09,541 --> 00:01:14,141
I should have kept the bleeding all alone.

9
00:01:16,521 --> 00:01:27,621
Her knuckles white around the plastic, 
Fighting for Luna — the love she tried to save.

10
00:01:29,850 --> 00:01:43,494
I watch her shadow trembling in the hallway, 
Drowning in the wave of pain I gave.

11
00:01:44,062 --> 00:01:55,462
Her voice begins to crack, the cracks turn raw, 
Screaming at the silence on the line.

12
00:01:55,611 --> 00:02:08,211
Losing all control, pounding on the wall, 
Begging for a mercy they deny.

13
00:02:08,228 --> 00:02:18,350
"Listen to me! Don't you dare hang up!" 
Then a sudden click that turns the light right out.

14
00:02:20,289 --> 00:02:33,822
Her desperate plea dissolves into the dark, 
Holding the plastic, the line already dead.

15
00:02:48,931 --> 00:02:54,264
I stand up slow upon the creaking wood,

16
00:02:55,364 --> 00:02:59,720
Turn my back on the ruin down below.

17
00:03:01,586 --> 00:03:05,675
Step by step, retreating to the dark,

18
00:03:07,986 --> 00:03:12,686
Carrying a debt I'll always owe.

19
00:03:14,342 --> 00:03:20,120
One step... for the secret I should have kept.

20
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:26,620
Two steps... for the tears she shouldn't have wept.

21
00:03:26,875 --> 00:03:32,553
Three steps... to lock the door inside my chest,

22
00:03:33,116 --> 00:03:38,582
And leave my broken mother to her rest.

23
00:03:38,949 --> 00:03:44,304
It is all over now,

24
00:03:45,478 --> 00:03:49,978
 the silence is complete.

25
00:03:52,305 --> 00:03:56,650
Walking through the wreckage at my feet.

26
00:03:58,376 --> 00:04:02,809
The weight of everything I never said,

27
00:04:04,627 --> 00:04:09,394
Is haunting every shadow

28
00:04:10,406 --> 00:04:13,106
where I tread.

